00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:04.620
subscribe to every idea about all of these issues,&nbsp;
whether usually with cultural issues, there is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:09.600
slice of the left which will say you're not really&nbsp;
