00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:16.560
whereas on the right the MAGA versus anti&nbsp;
MAGA stuff is really ugly and we'll see to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:21.600
what extent it's destructive, but it's lost them.&nbsp;
A bunch of elections so far. So, I mean, listen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:26.940
it'd be great if the entire left can get on the&nbsp;
same page and then we all sing Kumbaya and all of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:32.280
this stuff. The reality is that there's a spectrum&nbsp;
of the left from center left Democrats all the way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:39.240
